17:52:20 out   --- MECHANICS
17:52:20 out   # Minecraft Jukebox - mechanics sheet
17:52:20 out   This is a player, not a combat game, so the "mechanics" are the timing,
17:52:20 out   navigation, layout and playback rules that make the jukebox feel like the
17:52:20 out   Minecraft block. There is no reference build in this workspace, so every value
17:52:20 out   that the request did not specify is marked **estimated**. The request values are
17:52:20 out   marked **request**.
