18:07:17 out   {"version":2,"items":[{"User":"Build a native macOS desktop app in Rust called \"Minecraft Jukebox\" that works like a Minecraft jukebox, so I can listen to Minecraft music discs without opening the game.\n\nSTACK (Rust only)\n- Rust 2021, single Cargo project, no web frontend, no other languages.\n- GUI: eframe/egui.\n- Audio: rodio with Ogg Vorbis support (symphonia or lewton), playing .ogg files directly.\n- Other crates: serde + serde_json (parse Minecraft asset index), rfd (native folder picker), image (load PNG textures), dirs (find home directory), anyhow (error handling).\n- Must compi…
