19:17:37 out   # Minecraft Jukebox - mechanics sheet
19:17:37 out   This is a player, not a combat game, so the "mechanics" are the timing,
19:17:37 out   navigation, layout and playback rules that make the jukebox feel like the
19:17:37 out   Minecraft block. There is no reference build in this workspace, so every value
19:17:37 out   that the request did not specify is marked **estimated**. The request values are
19:17:37 out   marked **request**.
