19:17:37 out   |---|---|---|
19:17:37 out   | Music discs in the catalogue | 18 | request |
19:17:37 out   | Discs: 13, cat, blocks, chirp, far, mall, mellohi, stal, strad, ward, 11, wait, pigstep, otherside, 5, relic, creator, precipice | exact list | request |
19:17:37 out   | Grid columns at the default window width | 9 (two rows of 18 discs) | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Grid columns at narrower widths | 6 / 5 / 4 | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Disc card width | computed from available width, 80 px minimum | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Disc artwork size in a card | 38-64 px, nearest-neighbour | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Selected disc highlight | 2 px gold border + gold title | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Missing track marker | 4 px red square + "MISSING" | estimated |
