19:17:37 out   | Insert easing | ease-out cubic | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Eject animation duration | 0.45 s | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Eject motion | disc rises 32% of jukebox height, scales 1.0 to 0.85, fades out | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Jukebox idle bob while playing | 2 px amplitude, 4 rad/s | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Jukebox art size | 250 px, clamped to 42% of panel width | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Jukebox slot | top 11-28% of the block, centred | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Insert sparkles | 7 squares orbiting the slot for the insert duration | estimated |
