19:17:37 out   | Note rise speed | 48 px/s (0.85-1.3x random) | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Note horizontal sway | 10 px/s amplitude (5-14 random) | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Maximum live notes | 40 | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Note glyph variants | eighth note, beamed pair, sparkle, quarter note | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Note colours | gold, cyan, magenta, green, orange, purple, white plus the disc accent | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Notes stop on eject or track end | yes | request |
