19:17:37 out   | Value | Value | Source |
19:17:37 out   |---|---|---|
19:17:37 out   | Default volume | 70% | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Volume range | 0-100% | request |
19:17:37 out   | Now Playing line | `NOW PLAYING: Artist - Title` | request |
19:17:37 out   | Progress seek | click/drag on the bar | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Duration fallback when Ogg probe fails | 180 s | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Audio decoder | Ogg Vorbis via rodio + symphonia | request |
19:17:37 out   | Repeat default | off | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Space key | play / eject | request |
