19:17:37 out   | Panel style | 2 px dark border, 2 px bevel, 1 px inner line | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Button hover | lighter stone fill + 1 px white inner outline | estimated |
19:17:37 out   | Button press | inverted bevel and 1 px text offset | estimated |
